<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! Lady Aki — Annotated Character Sheet (working copy)

//FTLS / SDM+ alpha playtest. OGA-era table sheet. Powers remain deferred. Rulings and proposals have explicit provenance below.//

''Player-Daemon:'' Freyja  
''Character:'' Lady Aki  
''Level:'' 2  

Lady Aki walks between shrines, kingdoms, roads, and glades. Her rites bind. Her potions heal. Her illusions open doors. Spores, silk, bells, and blessings follow her path.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/annotation-ledger`>>

!! Annotated Working Copy — Read Before Play

''Status:'' DRAFT / source-preserving review copy. This document lives outside the canonical bags/ tree. The original Lady Aki .mem stays unchanged.
