''Governing comparisons:'' SDM Quickstart Ch. 1; SDM Traits and Gear Indexes; Our Golden Age; FTLS Powers and ECM / Heritage / companion sheets.
''Provenance markers:'' RULING = operator and Episkopos decision; SOURCE = retrieved rule or sheet; PROPOSAL = new playtest procedure; OPEN = requires a decision or reconciliation.

