The shrine and towed wagon carry the bulk workshop, packed kit, spare reagents, repairs and cultivated outputs. The shrine's companion sheet tracks 9 stone-scale item slots on its own body plus a separate 6-sack towed wagon. Keep allocations and readiness on that sheet as the quartermaster assigns cargo.

Compatible surplus from the shrine, Mother Spore daughter-ring, homunculi and Ichi's Glowkin mycelial golem substrate may serve as ''raw material'' for Alchemist Path-Magic. Any transfer of stored Mana/Life-equivalent credit, temporary ward, ritual catalyst or overcharge reserve needs an identified recipe, amount, shelf life, capacity and upkeep cost. Aki should not extract Ichi's maintenance tissue or the household's survival supplies without accounting for consequences.

