!!! Reskin Doctrine

Aki's renamed gear keeps the canonical SDM+ basis, price, rules, bulk, and mechanical effect unless an FTLS alpha ruling says otherwise.

Discounts track supply channel and cultural fit:
* Adventurer's Guild: 15%
* Spider Folk heritage: 50%
* stacked SF+AG: 42.5% of list price


!!! Annotation — Bookkeeping Disagreement (OPEN)
Original prose records 228.50 uncommitted cash. A prior row-by-row audit of the companion CSV calculated 229.50 uncommitted cash, a one-unit difference in on-body expenditure. This annotated copy preserves the unmodified prose value above until the ledger reconciles; do not silently promote either amount.

